  "news": [
    {
      "head": "Teddy's back for the big one",
      "html": "<p>The Teddy trilogy ends with its biggest adventure yet: <b>Teddy's Little Biggest Adventure</b>. Seventeen stops, a dream run, every place and friend from the first two games, and four heroes: Teddy, Gwinn, Doc Leo (at last!) and THE CHEZ, which you get to drive. Mind the charge.</p>"
    },
    {
      "head": "Since last issue: Best Behaved?",
      "html": "<p>Tune-Up got the Clown Club band's trunk back to the bandstand, instrument by instrument, and the BBS hasn't stopped asking about the farm's cowbell. Teddy's Little Bigger Adventure players are still being very good about not posting how the Best Behaved ring turns out; keep it that way. The most-asked question: is SNIFF really better than rolling over? Teddy says yes. He is a professional.</p>"
    },
    {
      "head": "Around the Sandbox: From a snow shovel to here",
      "html": "<p>Two years ago this company was the family 286, a snow shovel and a box of GAME-MAKER. Since then: a future, a smart home, a virus, a galaxy, a sandbox, a big town, a theater, a library, a snowstorm, a render, a kingdom, a fair, and now a birthday. Teddy still sleeps on the modem cable. Gwinn still sits about halfway. Doc Leo still leaves the spotlight on, and THE CHEZ is still charging. Thank you for reading.</p>"
    },
    {
      "head": "In the workshop: Your turn",
      "html": "<p>For the first time since issue 1, the workbench is clear. What comes next is up to you: every Sandbox game was made with GAME-MAKER, and if you can draw a block, you can make a game. Upload yours to our BBS, 1-412-555-SAND. We'll print the best of them here.</p>"
    },
    {
      "head": "Letters: \"Is it really Teddy's birthday?\"",
      "html": "<p>We can't say. We really can't. Gwinn would never forgive us. Play to the end.</p>"
    }
  ],
