          "scenes": [
            15
          ],
          "ask": "Firefly Meadow: a sign by the road says GWINN'S FACE. Three garden gates stand in the hedge, each with a board of seven signs. Which one opens?",
          "turn": {
            "inner": "Gwinn",
            "outer": "Gwinn"
          },
          "answer": "The middle gate, up the first plank step. Its board reads slice, paw, nose, balloon, star, balloon, hat."
